# MASTER PROMPT: PREMIUM LAW FIRM WEBSITE WITH COURSES, BLOGS, TEAM, AND SECURE CLIENT PORTAL

## PROJECT OVERVIEW

Act as an elite UI/UX designer, senior full-stack engineer, cybersecurity specialist, database architect, SEO expert, and legal technology consultant.

Build a premium, modern, highly interactive, responsive, and secure law firm website for an Indian legal practice. The website must communicate trust, professional excellence, confidentiality, integrity, and authority.

This must be a complete, functional web application, not just a static design, landing page, or frontend prototype.

The website must include:

- Professional law firm homepage.
- About the firm and advocate profile.
- Practice areas and individual service pages.
- Our Team section with individual profiles.
- Courses platform with enrollment and student learning dashboard.
- Legal Blogs and knowledge hub.
- Appointment booking system.
- Secure contact and inquiry forms.
- Secure client portal.
- Protected administrator dashboard.
- Search, filters, notifications, and interactive components.
- Privacy policy, terms, and legal disclaimers.
- Database integration, authentication, security controls, and testing.

All modules must work together within one cohesive application. Avoid disconnected pages, dead buttons, fake submissions, placeholder interactions, and inconsistent design.

